&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience within a renewables origination team, supporting commercial, analytical and strategic work in renewable energy markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to how data analysis, product strategy and process improvement support business development and client-facing activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to contribute to presentations, commercial analysis, Salesforce-related process automation and AI-enabled workflow improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close learning and mentorship from experienced commercial and analytical professionals in a global commodities business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Renewables Origination team on commercial, analytical and process improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research on renewable energy developers, projects, corporate off-takers and potential partnership or deal opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, improve and analyse CRM data to support pipeline visibility, reporting and workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse market, client, commercial or process data to generate insights that support business development and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support product strategy work, including research, analysis and preparation of presentation materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process automation and workflow improvement initiatives, including Salesforce-related activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore practical applications of AI-enabled tools or machine learning to improve team processes and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings clearly to commercial, technical and operational stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-functional coordination with teams such as trading, legal and operations, where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a motivated, intellectually curious individual who is keen to apply analytical, commercial and technical skills to real business challenges in renewable energy markets. You should be comfortable working with data, learning quickly, preparing clear materials, and collaborating with commercial and technical stakeholders in a fast-paced environment. Given the role’s Berlin-based commercial context, business-level proficiency in both English and German is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following experiences and skills are essential for application:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic background in a relevant discipline such as Industrial Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, Energy Economics, Business Administration, Finance, Data Science, Computer Science or a related quantitative or commercial field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good data analysis skills, including some experience with Python or a similar analytical tool, with the motivation to develop further technical capability during the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of applying data analysis, coding, automation, commercial analysis or quantitative methods to a practical problem, gained through academic projects, internships, research, personal projects or other relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable interest in renewable energy markets, including an ability to discuss relevant industry developments, gained through academic study, projects, internships, research or personal interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including the ability to prepare clear presentations and explain analysis to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English and German proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, commercial mindset and a collaborative approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following would be advantageous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Microsoft Excel, data visualisation, machine learning, AI tools or workflow automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Salesforce or other CRM, workflow or process automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with renewables origination, PPAs, renewable asset development, energy economics or power markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience preparing business presentations, commercial analysis or strategy materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe in inclusivity and are therefore dedicated to ensuring all employees – across gender identity, race, ethnicity, sexual orientation, religion, life experience, background and more – feel welcome and included in the company. We promote diversity because we believe it is essential to our ability to think holistically.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engelhart was founded in 2013 by BTG Pactual Group as a commodities trading company. Our business model is “asset light” and highly diversified – giving us the ability to adapt effectively and nimbly to changing market conditions. We have assembled successful multidisciplinary teams, leveraging advanced fundamental analysis with deep quantitative and weather research capabilities.&amp;nbsp; Our activities are underpinned by strong risk management practices and by powerful technology and operational excellence. We have exceptional teams with diverse global backgrounds and decades of experience, and are driven by a highly collaborative culture, across products and competencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2024, Engelhart acquired Trailstone, a global energy trading and technology company. The acquisition provides us with new expertise, analytics and proprietary technology which is being used to provide risk management and optimisation services to help maximise the value of our clients’ renewable power. The acquisition also expanded Engelhart’s capabilities into physical natural gas across North America, a critical fuel to support the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our talented and experienced individuals work together according to its four company values: &lt;strong&gt;Performance, Agility, Collaboration, Entrepreneurship&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power Trading &amp;amp; Renewables Analytics Internship Program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Six-Month Internship: 15 February – 12 August 2027&lt;br&gt;Berlin or Grenoble (full-time, on site)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engelhart’s Internship Program offers a unique opportunity to gain hands-on experience in renewables and power trading analytics. Interns will work closely with front office teams on data-led projects that support commercial decision-making, optimisation, and risk management across energy markets. To be eligible for consideration, &lt;strong&gt;applicants must have the right to work in the relevant internship location and be available to commence their six-month internship from 15 February 2027&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The internship opportunities covered by this advert are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power Analytics Intern, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PPA Optimisation Analytics Intern, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing Risk Management Analytics Intern, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systematic Quantitative Research Intern, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Renewables Portfolio Analytics Intern, Grenoble&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants may indicate areas of particular interest during the process, but final role allocation will be based on business need, candidate profile and overall fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are also hiring for Renewables Origination and Weather Analytics internships in Berlin. These have separate application processes due to their different candidate profiles. Further details are available on our Careers Page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Can Expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Hands-on experience on a dedicated renewables, power or balancing risk management desk, depending on the internship you are hired for, working on projects with real commercial relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to how data, analytics and optimisation support trading, portfolio management or risk management decisions in energy markets, depending on desk requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close learning and mentorship from experienced front office professionals, including direct exposure to desk leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured six-month internship within a global commodities business, combining cohort-based learning with deep desk integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Example Project Areas&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the internship opportunity, projects may include working with large trading, market or asset-related datasets, supporting optimisation work linked to renewable assets, PPAs, BESS, balancing risk management or systematic trading strategies, and developing Python-based analytical tools, predictive models, dashboards or workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with a front office team on data-led projects within renewables, power or balancing risk management, depending on the internship role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse large market, trading or asset-related datasets to identify insights that support commercial decision-making, portfolio management, systematic trading strategies and, where relevant, automated trading execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, test or improve analytical tools, models, dashboards or workflows using Python and other relevant tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support optimisation under uncertainty, forecasting, predictive modelling, simulation, reporting or risk management activities, depending on desk requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market research and present findings clearly to technical and commercial stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to day-to-day desk activity, building practical understanding of how analytics supports trading and portfolio decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across our 2027 internship program, we are looking for motivated, intellectually curious individuals who are keen to apply strong analytical and technical skills to real business challenges in power and renewables markets. You should be comfortable working with data, learning quickly, and collaborating closely with front office teams in a fast-paced trading environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following experiences and skills are essential for application:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic background in a quantitative discipline such as Engineering, Mathematics, Computer Science, Data Science, Statistics, Economics, Quantitative Economics, Finance, Energy Economics or a related STEM field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills, with the ability to analyse, manipulate and interpret complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in statistics, econometrics, machine learning, predictive modelling or optimisation, with the ability to apply quantitative methods to practical trading, market or risk problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with a structured and detail-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of applying data analysis, coding or quantitative methods to a practical problem, gained through academic projects, internships, research, personal projects or other relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable interest in energy markets, including an ability to discuss relevant industry developments in power, renewables, risk management or commodities trading, gained through academic study, projects, internships, research, or personal interest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level English proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in Germany and/or Switzerland for the full duration of the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication skills and a collaborative mindset, with the confidence to work closely with commercial and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectual curiosity, with the motivation to understand how market fundamentals, data and commercial decisions interact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following would be advantageous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL, data visualisation, advanced modelling techniques or applying machine learning / AI to market, trading or quantitative research problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to optimisation, forecasting, time-series analysis, quantitative finance, algorithmic trading concepts or large trade/market datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe in inclusivity and are therefore dedicated to ensuring all employees – across gender identity, race, ethnicity, sexual orientation, religion, life experience, background and more – feel welcome and included in the company. We promote diversity because we believe it is essential to our ability to think holistically.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is seeking an experienced Regional Services Partner to lead our Enterprise Sector Services business in the EMEA Central region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of commercial ownership, customer engagement, and delivery excellence. You will be responsible for driving services bookings growth across federal, state, and regulated public institutions while ensuring successful execution of a portfolio of complex engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Regional Services Leader, you will partner closely with Enterprise Sector Account Executives, Solution Architects, Delivery teams, and Customer Success to define and execute tailored services strategies that accelerate time to value and drive long-term adoption of Elastic solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means consistently achieving Services bookings and revenue targets while delivering predictable, high-quality outcomes for Enterprise Sector customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and achieve Services bookings and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory services strategy aligned with account plans and long-term adoption objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate forecasting and proactively manage pipeline gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the services bid and negotiation lifecycle, including scope, pricing, contract structures, and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive discovery and shape outcome-oriented services offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling Statements of Work tied to measurable milestones and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Elastic Services as a strategic enabler for transformation initiatives within Enterprise&amp;nbsp; Sector organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a portfolio of concurrent engagements, ensuring delivery within cost, margin, and customer satisfaction expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide governance oversight for strategic accounts, managing escalations and aligning Sales, Delivery, and Customer Success stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate risks, facilitate steering meetings, and ensure structured reporting and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic advisor, aligning Elastic Services to customer mission objectives and regulatory constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively within a matrixed organization across Sales, Delivery, Operations, and Partner teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in Professional Services, program delivery, or pre-sales roles within enterprise technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with Enterprise Sector organizations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven commercial ownership of services bookings targets, including forecasting and complex contract negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in delivering technology solutions in search, observability, analytics, or security domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple concurrent engagements with governance and risk oversight responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50% (and occasionally internationally).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Elasticsearch and related technologies (Linux, NoSQL, distributed systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP, PRINCE2, or Scrum Master certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a billable consultant or project manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to obtain SU2 security clearance if required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-PF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws, view posters linked below:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/fmlaen.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Family and Medical Leave Act (FMLA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/ofccp/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Nondiscrimination Provision&lt;/a&gt; Poster; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppabw.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Employee Polygraph Protection Act (EPPA)&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Poster and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt; (Poster)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Real Chemistry, making the world a healthier place isn’t just an aspiration—it’s our everyday reality. Our drive to transform healthcare is informed by our blend of deep scientific expertise, human-centred creativity, and AI-driven insights, fostering a unique environment where innovation thrives and our people are impact-obsessed. As a global agency, we provide a full suite of services across healthcare communications and marketing to our clients, including top players in the pharmaceutical and biotech industries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our #LifeatRealChem culture is rooted in our people—we believe we are best together and are committed to excellence for both our clients and colleagues. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned professional or just starting your career, if you share our passion for healthcare and connection, we invite you to explore our opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discover your purpose. Embrace innovation. Experience #LifeatRealChem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Medical Writer/Senior Medical Writer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Real Chemistry Germany&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be the first hire in our German-based content team, and will be responsible for developing materials across medical affairs and marketing projects in a range of therapy areas for top pharma clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As this role will be working on international and global work, we will require fluency in both German and English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will you be doing? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking responsibility for the day-to-day delivery of scientific content across medical affairs and marketing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and maintaining a thorough understanding of assigned therapeutic areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaising directly with clients and external experts on therapy area and content strategy (with occasional on-site travel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the client services, strategy and creative teams on strategy development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking an interest in AI tools to enhance efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and mantaining a knowledge of regulations across Germany and wider Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting the senior team with developing pitch materials and proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Already working as Medical Writer or Senior Medical Writer in a medical affairs or healthcare advertising/marketing agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong scientific background with a degree in a scientific or medical discipline (post-graduate degree preferred).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion and profound understanding of, healthcare, science, medicine, and the pharmaceutical industry is essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interacting with clients and KOLs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full fluency in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is proud to be Great Place to Work®&amp;nbsp;certified; check out what our people shared about our culture and workplace on our Great Places to Work Profile&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.greatplacetowork.com%2Fcertified-company%2F7038366&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185888156%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=pwvaCn37QXkjVQ0p6u92Oz4FA4j5NQZoNJL0ffy01qs%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe we can do our best when feeling our best, which is why we’ve put together a benefits program designed to give you the support you and your family need at every stage of life. Real Chemistry offers a comprehensive benefit program and perks, tailored to your region. Globally, this includes offices in our key markets with free snacks to keep you running all day long, generous holiday and paid time off, options for private medical, dental, and vison plans, and support in saving for the future. Other perks include mental wellness coaching and support&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;access to more than 13,000 online classes with LinkedIn Learning.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Learn more about our great benefits and perks and search specific offerings in your region at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.realchemistrybenefits.com&quot;&gt;www.realchemistrybenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;At Real Chemistry, we believe we&#39;re at our best when we&#39;re connected. Our Real Hybrid and Regional Teams (Real HART) approach is designed to foster collaboration, learning, innovation, and meaningful relationships while providing flexibility where appropriate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Because our workforce spans multiple countries, regions, and client needs, work arrangements may vary by role and location. Some positions offer hybrid or remote flexibility, while others require regular in-office presence. For example, certain teams and regions, including some of our UK operations, have office-based requirements. Your recruiter will discuss the specific expectations for the role you&#39;re pursuing during the interview process and keep you informed throughout the hiring journey.&amp;nbsp;For employees located within a one-hour commute of a Real Chemistry office, we require in-person attendance two days per week, either from a Real Chemistry office or when working onsite with clients. Employees in regions without a nearby office may work remotely and come together throughout the year for collaboration, culture-building, learning, and team connection opportunities.&amp;nbsp;While these guidelines reflect our current workplace model, we understand that everyone’s circumstances are unique. If you require additional flexibility, we welcome an open conversation with your recruiter and our HR team to discuss your needs and determine what may be possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Real Chemistry is an Equal Opportunity employer. We continually strive to build and sustain an inclusive and equitable work environment where our employees feel empowered to leverage all they bring from their personal lived experience and professional expertise, to make our team the best in the industry. We encourage motivated and qualified applicants to apply without regard to race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, ethnic or national origin, age, physical or mental disability, genetic information, marital information, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local employment discrimination laws where Real Chemistry operates. Should you require accommodations throughout the interview process please let your recruiter know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Notice: Real Chemistry and its affiliates&#39; names are being misused by scammers through messaging services, fake websites, and apps. Do not share personal or financial information or make payments to any unverified sources claiming to be connected to Real Chemistry. We are working to stop these unauthorized activities and protect our community. Read more&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.realchemistry.com%2Fscam-alert&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Cclehmar%40realchemistry.com%7C1f18aaed4326491b3efc08ddd690f025%7C6fa5bfc4f95843f8bb395d382689654b%7C0%7C0%7C638902640185967986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=vBa1KYjD6TUHgTF3FdPRQZvM8E8WUgHZqu9yHevh1%2BI%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;collapsed-field-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3061 - Associate Director, Planning - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fantastic opportunity to join the Ministry of Justice (MoJ) team as a Planning Associate Director.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Associate Director, you are critical to the delivery of this ambition; working closely with the Senior Associate Director, you will be a key interface for our clients and lead planning projects from start to finish, acting as the conduit who brings together our specialists to deliver exceptional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee the day-to-day running of the account, ensuring flow and accuracy of work and that the campaign management process follows best practice. You are across all communications and establish yourself as the first port of call for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build a strong relationship with your clients and become a trusted strategic partner – showing a deep understanding of your clients’ business and how communications can drive growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong management and client relationship skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management skills to support AD in the management and development of Planners and Execs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution focused mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enthusiasm, curiosity, and a team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated; an ambition to make the ordinary extraordinary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A thirst to learn – be that the client’s business, people, brands, industry, trends etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to prioritise and delegate, as well as manage both up and down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic and self-aware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to drive business results for both client &amp;amp; EssenceMediacom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, proactive approach to problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurate verbal and written feedback and instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3562 - Associate Director, Investment, Global&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exceptional opportunity to join our expanding Global Investment Team, working across high-profile &lt;strong&gt;clients&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and contributing directly to our mission of driving client transformation. You will leverage your existing media knowledge and gain hands-on experience in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Investment Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop a holistic overview of WPP Media global investment targets,&amp;nbsp;support WPP Media&#39;s&amp;nbsp;advanced trading products, and identify holistic media value opportunities at an unprecedented scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Partnerships &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with WPP Media global partners. Identify and implement innovative&amp;nbsp;investment solutions and strategies, integrating advanced AI&amp;nbsp;and data-driven insights, to unlock new value for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work with our most significant clients&amp;nbsp;and collaborate seamlessly with colleagues across global&amp;nbsp;markets, spanning Asia, North America, Europe, and LatAm, gaining invaluable international experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are actively raising the bar in investment, digital, data management, technology, and AI-driven solutions. This role is exciting, fast-paced, and provides a fantastic platform to develop&amp;nbsp;your media career rapidly, giving you a competitive edge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking media professionals with experience who are ready to take on more responsibility and elevate their career to the next level. Your current experience may have been built at an auditor, as a buyer within a local market, at a media vendor or within a regional or global investment management agency team. Key skills and areas of focus for this role include:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Analytical Prowess:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your existing aptitude for maths&amp;nbsp;and attention to detail will be critical, as well as your curious nature to ask questions, understand the context and build the data story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have&amp;nbsp;advanced skills in data analysis&amp;nbsp;and be looking to develop data visualisation skills&amp;nbsp;using industry-leading tools such as Power BI. An interest in code, VBA/macro writing&amp;nbsp;skills, Alteryx or Tableau will be an advantage but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enhanced Collaboration &amp;amp; Strategic Relationships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and managing strategic and sometimes complex relationships with colleagues across teams&amp;nbsp;and key external partners, influencing outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and nurturing strong relationships with global clients, amplifying our obsession with driving their business and supporting their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will actively contribute to and take step to lead a positive environment, fostering team spirit, driving inclusion&amp;nbsp;and high-level collaboration across parties&amp;nbsp;on complex projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Problem-Solving &amp;amp; Strategic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will proactively develop solution-focused approaches, leading client and auditor conversations to discuss, align, and resolve challenges, using innovation in your approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further develop your market intelligence, understanding global media markets, media channel evolution, measurement approaches, and trading metrics at a strategic level and look for opportunities within their application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on identifying practical applications for technology and AI usage within the teams’ operational processes, to maximise efficiency and unlock new ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach and a hunger for learning will be critical in the fast-evolving industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop&amp;nbsp;more junior team members, responsible for driving high-quality work and learning agendas, thereby enhancing your leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and lead key workstreams for critical global clients, delivering to deadlines, resolving challenges and simplifying results story to gain attention and traction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capability at prioritising, adapting, and maintain a solutions-focused approach in a demanding, global&amp;nbsp;environment and ability to bring junior team members on the journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key involvement in global new business pitches, supporting to create the most competitive and holistic offers, working in an existing and fast paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercial approach in creating solutions and managing commitments is key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Involvement in workstreams around WPP Media&#39;s&amp;nbsp;advanced trading products, and a focus on unlocking holistic media value opportunities will be critical to this role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Championing Growth and Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Create an Open environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;  Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
